<title>USA: Intellicell hires new auditor.</title>
<headline>Intellicell hires new auditor.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intellicell Corp said Friday it retained BDO Seidman LLP as independent accountants to audit the company's financial statements for the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said BDO Seidman replaces Richard Eisner &amp; Co LLP, which resigned as the company's accountant on April 9.</p>
<p>The company said its Audit Committee has also retained Irell &amp; Manella LLP, of Los Angeles as special counsel, which has retained Arthur Andersen LLP as special auditor to address the circumstances surrounding the resignation of Eisner.</p>
</text>
